note2web — Third-Party Notices
===============================

note2web's Apple Notes export path (`ruby/note2web_export.rb`) is a driver
script that, at runtime, requires (via Ruby `require`) library files from an
external clone of the following third-party project. note2web does NOT vendor
or redistribute that project's source code in this repository or in the npm
package; the user is expected to `git clone` it separately and point
`exporter.parser_path` at the clone (see README.md "Setup").

